        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   But, wasn't I the one who was appointed to this job? It took me forever to pry this job from Meteorite too...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "But, wasn't I the one who was appointed to this job? It took me forever to pry this job from Meteorite too..."
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   Hrmmm... Maybe she's here on another mission?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "Hrmmm... Maybe she's here on another mission?"
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   Well, seems like the bounty hunters are retreating?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "Well, seems like the bounty hunters are retreating?"
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
